# Canvases live in the repo

When you generate or update a `.canvas.tsx`:

1. Write the IDE copy under `~/.cursor/projects/home-benh-Source-dinkcast/canvases/` (Cursor only detects that path).
2. Also write the same canvas under [`docs/canvases/`](docs/canvases/) with SPDX `GPL-3.0-or-later` and a one-line header (see `docs/canvases/vram-budget.canvas.tsx`).
3. Do not leave a canvas only in the Cursor project folder. Include it in the same PR as the analysis.

Existing snapshots: [v0.2 plan](docs/canvases/v0-2-plan.canvas.tsx), [campaign graft audit](docs/canvases/campaign-graft-audit.canvas.tsx).
